      "content": "i feel like i'm just drowning. i've spent my whole life trying to do everything right, getting the degrees, the job, the status... and now i'm just stuck in this loop of debt and work that never ends. i'm so exhausted i can't even think straight anymore. i feel like im failing everyone around me and there's just no way to catch up. it feels like a treadmill that's going way too fast and i'm just gonna fall off eventually.",
